Subject: CPMS I03D Independent Schema and Typed Reader Observation

Description: Canonical formation for two bounded, independent observations over each public procedure root: exact-profile Draft 2020-12 schema validation and actual Rust serde binding. The contract preserves representation differences, stable findings, residuals, and intended-use identity without comparison, semantic execution, or authority admission. Formation grants no implementation authority.

